    "mechanism": "S5",
    "in_process": false,
    "summary": "S5 FD-passing process handoff with identity state transfer (new binary).",
    "justification": [
      "goroutine-structure, long-running or start-up code changed: in-process patching would leave old code running in goroutines that never return; a new process starts the new goroutine structure, and the old one is drained and exits",
      "S6 blockers (6): github.com/gotify/server/v2/api.OIDCAPI.CallbackHandler: start-up-only code already ran; its effect is baked into the live state, so patching it changes nothing; github.com/gotify/server/v2/api.ClientDatabase: interface method set changed (itabs and type assertions are compiled in); github.com/gotify/server/v2/api.MessageDatabase: interface method set changed (itabs and type assertions are compiled in); github.com/gotify/server/v2/api.pendingOIDCSession: layout of compiled-in type pendingOIDCSession changed (4 functions use it); S6 replaces functions, not types; github.com/gotify/server/v2/model.Client: layout of compiled-in type Client changed (11 functions use it); S6 replaces functions, not types; ... and 1 more"
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "Kubernetes rolling update (loses in-memory state, needs surge capacity)"
    ],
    "risks": [
      "github.com/gotify/server/v2/auth.GetTokenID is exported: callers outside the analysed module are not in the closure",
      "github.com/gotify/server/v2/auth.RegisterAuthentication is exported: callers outside the analysed module are not in the closure",
      "github.com/gotify/server/v2/auth.TryGetTokenID is exported: callers outside the analysed module are not in the closure",
      "new package-level variable github.com/gotify/server/v2/auth.timeNow: under S6 it lives in the patch plugin and is re-initialised by every later patch generation",
      "new package-level variable github.com/gotify/server/v2/model.DefaultElevationDuration: under S6 it lives in the patch plugin and is re-initialised by every later patch generation",
      "github.com/gotify/server/v2/test.unreadableReader.Read is exported: callers outside the analysed module are not in the closure",
      "changed functions are small enough to be inlined; with S6 slot trampolines the call still dispatches through the slot, but raw binary patching (internal/livepatch) must also patch the inlining callers: github.com/gotify/server/v2/api.UserAPI.CreateUser, github.com/gotify/server/v2/auth.Auth.evaluateOr401, github.com/gotify/server/v2/auth.GetUserID",
      "no patched function has a context.Context parameter: S6 gives per-call (not per-request) consistency, so one request may mix old and new versions of the 36 functions",
      "type information is partial (286/293 type errors old/new; third-party packages are opaque): call-graph and state reachability are lower bounds",
      "quiescence: old activations of main(), init-started or long-running goroutines never return, so the old process is retired by exit, not by draining; set a drain deadline in the S5 upgrader"
    ]
  },
